    "name": "KEERTHI VMS — Sales to Delivery POD API Flow",
    "description": "Run only against a dedicated test site. Uses separate API tokens per role. Creates a Shop Visit, draft Sales Order, submitted order, allocation, delivery trip, and POD. One test customer and one order item/stop are expected.",
